D realm. This innovative mixed reality game offers intellectually stimulating \"Draw-to-Win\" puzzle challenges, seamlessly blends the familiar drawing mechanic with immersive 3D environments, creating a gaming experience that's both refreshingly new and engagingly challenging. In Doodle Quest, you will\n\n- Act as a mischievous magic artist, use magic brush to create physic-based magical touches to solve seemingly impossible challenges, with a simple yet captivating gameplay mechanics.\n\n- Solve a wide variety of levels and challenges, including 200+ exquisitely designed levels, 20+ distinctive composition modules, 3 types of drawing materials of different physics properties.\n\n- Immerse yourself in an effortlessly learnable and delightfully playable experience with a charming art style and soothing music. Supports MR see through and hand-tracking game control.\n\n- (COMING SOON) Use level editor to create countless possibilities for community-created levels.\n", "short_description": "Bringing your favorite \"Draw a line\" mobile game experience into 3D, Doodle Quest is an innovative mixed reality game featuring intellectually stimulating \"Draw-to-Win\" spatial puzzle challenges."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://skycamp-studio.github.io/Doodle-Quest/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Skycamp Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://skycamp-studio.github.io/Doodle-Quest/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": n